stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LandingPage: Visitor opens the Curis platform website

    state LandingPage {
        [*] --> HeroSection
        HeroSection --> CTA_HeroButton: Click "Get Started"

        note right of HeroSection
            - Headline: Communicates Curis' value to clinic assistants
            - Subheading: Highlights top benefits (e.g., faster check-ins, simplified schedules)
            - Background image/video: Shows receptionist using Curis
            - CTA Button: "Get Started"
        end note

        [*] --> FeaturesOverview

        note right of FeaturesOverview
            - Grid or carousel layout with icons + short text
            - Example features:
              • Patient Queue Management
              • Easy Appointment Scheduling
              • Real-time Doctor Availability
              • Task Reminders and Notes
        end note

        [*] --> TestimonialsSection

        note right of TestimonialsSection
            - Displays testimonials from clinic assistants or receptionists
            - May include names, roles, and photos
            - Optional star ratings or quote highlights
        end note


        [*] --> BenefitsSection

        note right of BenefitsSection
            - Clear bullet points:
              • Speed Up Patient Check-ins
              • Reduce Scheduling Errors
              • Keep Your Clinic Organized
            - Accompanied by icons or visuals
        end note

        [*] --> TrustIndicatorsSection

        note right of TrustIndicatorsSection
            - Shows badges or compliance labels (HIPAA, GDPR)
            - Trusted by clinics, hospitals, or health networks
            - Optional: Featured in or partnered with logos
        end note

        [*] --> ContactSection

        note right of ContactSection
            - "Contact Us" form with name, email, message fields
            - Email and optional phone support
            - Links to social platforms like LinkedIn and Twitter
        end note

        [*] --> FooterSection

        note right of FooterSection
            - Navigation links: About, FAQs, Privacy Policy, Terms
            - Social media icons
            - Copyright text
        end note

        %% CTAs distributed throughout the page
        LandingPage --> CTA_HeroButton: CTA (Hero)
        LandingPage --> CTA_FeaturesButton: CTA (Features Overview)
        LandingPage --> CTA_BenefitsButton: CTA (Benefits Section)
    }

    %% Navigation to Login
    CTA_HeroButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login on click
    CTA_FeaturesButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login
    CTA_DemoButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login
    CTA_BenefitsButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login

    LandingPage --> [*]: User exits site